'''Corviknight''' (Japanese: '''アーマーガア''' ''Armorga'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

