===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Corviknight|190}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Iron Wings''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Corviknight|135}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

